                <note rend="inline" type="source">493.11/1358: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Perkins</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-09-22T13:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 22,
                                1928—1 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>324. Your 700, September 11, 7 p.m. Your paragraphs 2 and 3 approved. Legation
                    should, however, inform the Minister for Foreign Affairs that this is to be
                    regarded as an emergency measure pending a formal arrangement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
